  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-con"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>수축</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>9.0%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-8.7%</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.99yr, B1)</b></span><span class="g warn"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>5/10</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>X</b></span><span class="g fail"><i></i><b>비중축소 17명</b></span></div>
