  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-non"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>무형</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>7.0%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>안마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-1.9%</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (≥2.32yr, B3+)</b></span><span class="g can"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>6/10</b></span></div>
  <div class="fold">▼</div>
